// Owner: Prathmesh
//
// Creates 1 NGO ("Hyderabad Youth Empowerment Trust") and 40 students with
// varied simulated playthroughs generated by running the engine's bot strategies,
// producing realistic stats, scores, and decisions. Writes supabase/seed.sql,
// which `pnpm db:reset` applies after the migrations.
//
// Merge fixes (integration review, 2026-10-10):
//   • creates auth.users + auth.identities rows (profiles/organizations reference
//     auth.users, so the old seed failed with a foreign-key error) — demo logins below;
//   • Mindset answers use real option ids (the old ids didn't exist → every score was 0),
//     and completed students also get a post-check, so "learning gain" has data;
//   • deterministic: engine bots via `playChapter` and seeded choices, no Math.random/Date.now;
//   • nicknames only (§6), two batches for the group filter.
//
// Demo logins (local / demo projects only):
//   NGO admin:  facilitator@demo.tosslife.invalid   /  TossLifeDemo-2026
//   Students:   username student_<nickname>_<n>      /  TossLifeDemo-2026
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

